Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" tit